<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721467260"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:40.720"><div begin="27.461" end="52.590" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="27.461" end="33.964" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.461" end="29.655">没有圆周的</span><span begin="29.655" end="30.475">钟</span><span begin="30.874" end="32.870">失去旋转意</span><span begin="32.870" end="33.964">义</span></p><p begin="35.097" end="39.880" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.097" end="35.980">下雨</span><span begin="35.980" end="36.779">这</span><span begin="36.779" end="37.312">天</span><span begin="37.530" end="38.331">好</span><span begin="38.331" end="39.150">安</span><span begin="39.150" end="39.880">静</span></p><p begin="40.338" end="47.003" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.338" end="42.484">远行没有目</span><span begin="42.484" end="43.445">的</span> <span begin="43.685" end="45.720">距离不是问</span><span begin="45.720" end="47.003">题</span></p><p begin="47.968" end="52.590" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.968" end="48.728">不爱</span><span begin="48.728" end="49.419">了</span><span begin="49.512" end="50.330">是你</span><span begin="50.330" end="51.114">的</span><span begin="51.114" end="51.930">谜</span><span begin="51.930" end="52.590">底</span></p></div><div begin="52.784" end="1:04.998" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="52.784" end="55.897" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.784" end="53.154">我占</span><span begin="53.154" end="53.552">据</span><span begin="53.552" end="54.650">格林威治守</span><span begin="54.650" end="55.055">候</span><span begin="55.055" end="55.451">着</span><span begin="55.451" end="55.897">你</span></p><p begin="55.935" end="59.039" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.935" end="56.335">在时</span><span begin="56.335" end="56.797">间</span><span begin="56.797" end="57.790">标准起点回</span><span begin="57.790" end="58.249">忆</span><span begin="58.249" end="58.630">过</span><span begin="58.630" end="59.039">去</span></p><p begin="59.144" end="1:02.123" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.144" end="59.538">你却</span><span begin="59.538" end="59.971">在</span><span begin="59.971" end="1:01.065">永夜了的极</span><span begin="1:01.065" end="1:01.419">地</span><span begin="1:01.419" end="1:01.854">旅</span><span begin="1:01.854" end="1:02.123">行</span></p><p begin="1:02.196" end="1:04.998" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.196" end="1:02.705">等爱在</span><span begin="1:02.705" end="1:03.190">失</span><span begin="1:03.190" end="1:03.657">温后</span><span begin="1:03.657" end="1:04.090">渐</span><span begin="1:04.090" end="1:04.342">渐</span><span begin="1:04.342" end="1:04.725">死</span><span begin="1:04.725" end="1:04.998">去</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.396" end="1:17.175" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:05.396" end="1:08.597" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.396" end="1:05.663">喔</span> <span begin="1:05.663" end="1:06.078">对不</span><span begin="1:06.078" end="1:06.354">起</span> <span begin="1:06.496" end="1:06.997">这句话</span><span begin="1:06.997" end="1:07.392">打乱</span><span begin="1:07.392" end="1:07.789">了</span><span begin="1:07.789" end="1:08.232">时</span><span begin="1:08.232" end="1:08.597">区</span></p><p begin="1:08.604" end="1:13.173" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.604" end="1:09.275">喔 你要</span><span begin="1:09.275" end="1:09.626">我</span><span begin="1:09.691" end="1:10.766">在最爱的时</span><span begin="1:10.766" end="1:11.149">候</span><span begin="1:11.149" end="1:11.518">睡</span><span begin="1:11.518" end="1:13.173">去</span></p><p begin="1:13.801" end="1:17.175" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.801" end="1:14.483">我</span><span begin="1:14.483" end="1:16.040">越想越清</span><span begin="1:16.040" end="1:17.175">醒</span></p></div><div begin="1:17.572" end="1:43.793" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:17.572" end="1:24.547" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.572" end="1:19.212">喔 爱你没</span><span begin="1:19.212" end="1:20.164">差</span> <span begin="1:20.829" end="1:22.291">那一点时</span><span begin="1:22.291" end="1:23.240">差</span> <span begin="1:23.613" end="1:24.547">喔</span></p><p begin="1:24.804" end="1:30.071" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.804" end="1:27.145">你离开这一拳</span><span begin="1:27.145" end="1:27.563">给</span><span begin="1:27.563" end="1:28.425">得</span><span begin="1:28.788" end="1:29.154">太</span><span begin="1:29.154" end="1:30.071">重</span></p><p begin="1:30.429" end="1:37.037" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.429" end="1:30.851">我</span><span begin="1:30.851" end="1:32.035">的心找</span><span begin="1:32.035" end="1:32.787">不</span><span begin="1:32.787" end="1:33.315">到</span><span begin="1:33.564" end="1:33.965">换</span><span begin="1:33.965" end="1:34.693">日线</span><span begin="1:34.693" end="1:35.130">它</span><span begin="1:35.130" end="1:35.952">在</span><span begin="1:35.952" end="1:37.037">哪</span></p><p begin="1:37.569" end="1:43.793" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.569" end="1:38.818">我只能</span><span begin="1:38.818" end="1:39.967">不停的</span><span begin="1:39.967" end="1:40.518">飞</span> <span begin="1:40.751" end="1:41.987">直到我</span><span begin="1:41.987" end="1:43.206">将你挽</span><span begin="1:43.206" end="1:43.793">回</span></p></div><div begin="1:43.597" end="2:10.442" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:43.597" end="1:50.137" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.597" end="1:44.782">爱你不</span><span begin="1:44.782" end="1:45.803">怕</span><span begin="1:46.376" end="1:46.801">那</span><span begin="1:46.801" end="1:48.004">一点时</span><span begin="1:48.004" end="1:48.871">差</span> <span begin="1:49.188" end="1:50.137">喔</span></p><p begin="1:50.410" end="1:55.910" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.410" end="1:51.606">就让我</span><span begin="1:51.606" end="1:53.275">静静一个</span><span begin="1:53.275" end="1:54.392">人</span><span begin="1:54.392" end="1:54.709">出</s